# @desc   Switch the bottom navigation tab from Home to Spend (legacy name: Reports). Triggers the ManualNavigateToReports Sentry span end-to-end (BottomTab click -> Spend screen layout completion). Assumes the user is signed in and the bottom nav bar is visible.
# @pre    id="HomePage"
# @pre    label="Spend"
# @post   id="SearchPageNarrow" || id="Search"
# @reset  .claude/skills/agent-device/flows/macros/switch-to-home.ad
# @span   ManualNavigateToReports
is exists "id=\"HomePage\""
is exists "label=\"Spend\""
press "label=\"Spend\""
wait "id=\"SearchPageNarrow\" || id=\"Search\"" 10000
